Adapted by dishanhai: MuWeapi, selected search/stream/lyric protocol logic from
MuNeteaseApi and MuQQApi (including QR login, QQ OAuth exchange and hash33),
and YRC timing from LyricParser. Player page structure is adapted from NCMScreen,
NavigateBar, ControlsBar, MusicLyricsPanel and AccountManagerOverlay at the same revision.
Modifications: UUK API integration, bounded HTTPS requests, MP3-only sources,
existing SHBUI lyric models and asynchronous session ownership.
These adaptations remain licensed under Apache-2.0, independently of SHBUI's MIT code.
The upstream NOTICE is reproduced unmodified. Selected protocols and page structure are used;
Skija, Skia, platform icons, custom-source scripts and DSP are not distributed here.
QR login adaptations use per-attempt, domain/path-scoped cookies, an exact HTTPS host
allowlist, finite background polling, cancellation and opt-in encrypted credential handoff.
Additional adaptations: account and playlist reads, NetEase liked-song operations and
both providers' search suggestions. QQ liked-song writes remain explicitly unsupported.
Page adaptations replace the upstream renderer with UUK/native widgets, semantic theme
colors, responsive navigation, search results, a persistent transport bar, contextual
lyrics and account-source cards. No unavailable upstream feature is presented as active.
The separately licensed JavaLayer decoder is documented in ../jlayer/SOURCE.
